{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22316","headline":"寄题盩厔厅前双松 · 白居易","name":"寄题盩厔厅前双松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昨爲吏日，折腰多苦辛。\n归来不自适，无计慰心神。\n手栽两树松，聊以当嘉宾。\n乘春日一溉，生意渐欣欣。\n清韵度秋在，绿茸随日新。\n始怜涧底色，不忆城中春。\n有时昼掩关，双影对一身。\n尽日不寂莫，意中如三人。\n忽奉宣室诏，徵爲文苑臣。\n闲来一惆怅，恰似别交亲。\n早知烟翠前，攀玩不逡巡。\n悔从白云里，移尔落嚣尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}